      "updated": 1714000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "⚠  Rasterization investigation required before Phase 1\noksvg + rasterx already exists in Go at internal/identitygen/raster.go — test trading card SVG + Satori SVG output through it.\nIf compatible → use Go backend for badges. Otherwise → Bun server + @resvg/resvg-js.",
